Source data attribution
================================================================================

The occupancy values in this Dataset are obtained from publicly accessible
Moscow Department of Transport parking data.

This Dataset is a derivative work: timestamps, parking metadata, and
occupancy snapshots have been collected, normalised, deduplicated, and
restructured for analytical use. The original source data is the property
of the Government of Moscow and is published under their own open data
terms.

